From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 21:18:15 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] vendor and adapt systemd 257 for legacy kernels
 (overlay/systemd)

Nixpkgs no longer ships systemd 257. Vendor the 257.10 definition from
the Nixpkgs 25.05 branch, merge the OpenEmbedded STATX_MNT_ID fallback,
and adapt the 25.05 definition to the current package-set ABI. Patch GCC
16.2.0's libgomp uid buffer, install the current NixOS unit set, and
expose the package flags current NixOS expects.

Select systemd 257 only for the legacy kernel; modern kernels use the
current systemd 262. Keep the old-kernel-patched 262 package as
systemd262oldkernel.
